[{"id":3317956837,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7FxADl","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"2adecffbc3faadfaf0855899aee7095c23b5fb69","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"Thanks! This makes sense to me. There's no need for script to be stored twice, especially since the `Variant` based storage can be less efficient and more error prone than the reference based one.\r\nWould be nice to get another voice from one more GDScript / C# maintainer, but I also don't see huge risks in this. The property has existed since the first commit. It's likely simply no longer needed.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111323#pullrequestreview-3317956837","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111323","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-09T09:10:10Z"},{"id":3319352368,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7F2Uww","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"2adecffbc3faadfaf0855899aee7095c23b5fb69","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","login":"dsnopek","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek"},"body":"Thanks!\r\n\r\nThis looks good to me. I'm glad this is also removing `set_script_and_instance()` - when working on PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102373 it was also [noted](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102373#discussion_r1941864293) that this method isn't really needed.\r\n\r\nThere is one potential risk here: if there are any GDExtensions providing scripting languages that depend on the `Ref<Script>` getting cached on the Godot side, and won't expect `get_script()` to get called so often. However, I think at worst this would be a performance issue, and not one that breaks compatibility? So, I think it should be fine","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111323#pullrequestreview-3319352368","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111323","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-09T14:42:11Z"},{"id":3320346943,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7F6Hk_","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"2adecffbc3faadfaf0855899aee7095c23b5fb69","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?u=0565b5d99d54afd5fda6712cd8eb05893572baed&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","login":"dalexeev","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev"},"body":"Looks good to me too, great catch! Even if we encounter some regression, we can always fix it or revert the change.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111323#pullrequestreview-3320346943","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111323","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-10-09T19:23:34Z"},{"id":3320599069,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7F7FId","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"2adecffbc3faadfaf0855899aee7095c23b5fb69","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?u=1b0467024f137e562b21748eb6bf12f97dfa5bf6&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","login":"raulsntos","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos"},"body":"The C# changes look good to me.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111323#pullrequestreview-3320599069","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111323","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-09T20:48:55Z"}]